{
    "test_name": "MOB.180_Home_Screen",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.180_Home_Screen",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.180` The Home screen renders and its tiles navigate (T2.7).\n- READ-ONLY. Nothing is written; the one navigation is undone by going back home.\n- **The landing route had no test at all.** Home is where login lands and where\n  `resync()` sends you before `client.resetStore()`, so it is on every user's path\n  every session.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **Cannot gate on a page title like the other nav tests.** `PageTitle` returns\n  `null` when `location.pathname === '/'`, so Home has no `#page-title` and no back\n  arrow. This test gates on the welcome banner instead.\n- **Tiles are located by `img[alt=\"icon for \u2026 url\"]`, never by their text.** The\n  hamburger menu renders the same six titles, so a text match would pass with the\n  tiles missing entirely (trap 5b). The menu's icons carry no `alt`.\n- The banner assertions reject the FALLBACKS (`Friend`, `No Associated Organization`),\n  which is what makes them evidence that `GET_SESSION` actually resolved rather than\n  evidence that a heading exists (trap 5).",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Navigation",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to the mobile home page",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the app shell and GET_SESSION settle",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 5
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The welcome banner rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Welcome,"
                },
                "type": "assertPageContains"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: the banner greets the SESSION USER, not the 'Friend' fallback",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const hs = [...document.querySelectorAll('h1,h2,h3')]\n  .map(e => (e.textContent || '').trim());\nconst w = hs.find(t => t.startsWith('Welcome,'));\nif (!w) return false;\n// Home.tsx falls back to 'Friend' when session.me.name is missing, so the\n// fallback rendering is exactly the failure this is here to catch.\nreturn w !== 'Welcome, Friend!' && /^Welcome, \\S.*!$/.test(w);"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: the org line names an org, not the 'No Associated Organization' fallback",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const hs = [...document.querySelectorAll('h3')]\n  .map(e => (e.textContent || '').trim());\nconst o = hs.find(t => t.startsWith('-') && t.endsWith('-'));\nif (!o) return false;\nreturn o !== '- No Associated Organization -';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Tile \"Asset Collector / Lens\" is present",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//img[@alt=\"icon for Asset Collector / Lens url\"]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
